[statement]
Two builds of one version, with different identities, in two repositories:
apk installs the one from the repository configured first. Each build
depends on a marker package that tells them apart.

[repository]
C:Q1AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=
P:foo
V:1.0
D:from-first

P:from-first
V:1

[repository]
C:Q1BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB=
P:foo
V:1.0
D:from-second

P:from-second
V:1

[request]
foo

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install from-first 1
install foo 1.0
